sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuario
  participant FE as Editor React
  participant API as FastAPI UML
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as WebSocket

  U->>FE: Mueve clase
  FE->>API: PATCH /uml/diagrams/{id}/visual-elements
  API->>DB: Actualiza posicion
  API-->>FE: Elemento visual
  FE->>WS: UML_EVENT MOVE_ELEMENT
  WS-->>FE: EVENT_ACK
  WS-->>FE: Broadcast a sala de proyecto
